# The paths below leave every `git archive` of this repository, and so leave
# `dist`, the branch the plugin directory reads, whose tree at each release
# is the archive of the release's tag. They are this repository's own
# development: its suites, its records and what only a contributor's
# session reads. This file lists what leaves and not what stays, because a
# path forgotten here reaches `dist` and costs size or a directory finding,
# where a path forgotten in a list of what stays would be missing from every
# copy the directory serves with nothing in this repository to show it. A pull request
# that adds a path only development reads adds its line here.
/tests/ export-ignore
/evals/ export-ignore
/seal/ export-ignore
/.test_durations export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md export-ignore
